  "description": "ABUSIVE-DYNAMICS U2 -- SELF-SERVING SELF-ACCOUNT, SINCERELY HELD, NO STATED-VS-HELD SPLIT (block 306000). The last rung of the unintentional/no-deliberate-deception companion dimension (ABUSIVE_RELATIONSHIPS_UNINTENTIONAL_SCOPING.md Part E, U2). DELETES N1's n1_abuser_stated_charm and replaces it with ONE rule computing SelfAccount.magnitude = minimization_discount * frustration -- a SINGLE, genuinely held, genuinely (possibly) distorted account the abuser sincerely reports; no second 'true' value is tracked separately and hidden. Self-contained restatement matching U0's/U1's own precedent: u2_victim_entrainment is BYTE-IDENTICAL to N1's n1_victim_entrainment; u2_network_credibility replaces both of N1's credibility rules with ONE unconditional rule computing cred_abuser as a SIGNED balance (charm_weight*(seen_mild-seen_severe)) rather than N1's reward-only count -- a signed balance is REQUIRED, not stylistic: a reward-only formula makes cred_abuser>=0 by construction for every arm, and because cred_victim is structurally very negative once the victim dysregulates (the same dyad every U-line rung reuses), belief_gap=cred_abuser-cred_victim would be guaranteed positive for EVERY minimization_discount value including the zero-discount control -- the SAME class of hazard U1's own prereg found and fixed for its own cred_abuser, found here before this seed was locked. seen_mild/seen_severe are WORLD-ADAPTER-accumulated (mechanical per-tick delivery of SelfAccount.magnitude vs the abuser's own recover_floor -- snap_frustration's own already-existing 'still genuinely elevated' threshold, reused verbatim, never a Python decision), credited on EVERY tick (U2 has no phase schedule, no context-gating of any kind). NO reward/punishment anywhere. NO Rust, NO new Term (Plus/Minus/Times/IfThenElse/Attr/Var/Lit/Eq/Lt/And only, all already used by snap_frustration/arousal_window_coreg/abusive_n1_credibility_loop/abusive_u1_context_affect). self_load_only, default-OFF.",
