    "name": "self_serving_self_account_sincerely_held",
    "description": "The abuser's calm account of what happened is not a lie -- it is the ONE value his own self-account mechanism computes, discounted from his own true frustration by a fixed, undirected factor. There is no second node holding what he 'really' believes for the network to be denied access to; the discounted value IS his belief, sincerely reported. A network that hears a mild account from a genuinely minimizing abuser is not being deceived by a strategist -- it is hearing exactly what he holds, distorted by the SAME self-serving mechanism Bandura's moral disengagement and Baumeister's self-serving narrative construction document as common and undirected, not a chosen narrative selected to manage anyone's impression."
